{'symbol': 'JCI', 'date': '2023-05-31 16:00:00', 'title': 'NRG PARK AND JOHNSON CONTROLS KICK OFF HISTORIC SUSTAINABILITY INITIATIVE SAVING AN ESTIMATED $54 MILLION AND REDUCING SIGNIFICANT GHG EMISSIONS', 'text': "THROUGH AN ENERGY SAVINGS PERFORMANCE CONTRACT, INFRASTRUCTURE UPDATES AT NRG PARK WILL BE ENTIRELY FUNDED BY SAVINGS, WITH ADDITIONAL SAVINGS REDIRECTED BACK TO HARRIS COUNTY. THE PROJECT WILL SIGNIFICANTLY REDUCE CARBON EMISSIONS IN ALIGNMENT WITH HARRIS COUNTY'S CLIMATE ACTION PLAN, WHICH AIMS TO REDUCE CARBON EMISSIONS BY 40% BY 2030."}